ng passthrough channel is unchanged. The hook is fully provider-local: `BaseConfig`, `utils.py`, and the vLLM/NIM passthrough are untouched ### Final Attestation - [x] The tests check the right things, including the edge cases, and regressions in the respective real-world customer use-cases are not possible after this PR
